WEBVTT

00:14:59.697 --> 00:15:03.930
on the same page of committing
to 2050 net zero,

00:15:03.963 --> 00:15:06.063
committing to this decade,

00:15:06.097 --> 00:15:08.363
having a road map
that is going to lay down

00:15:08.397 --> 00:15:12.030
how they are going to accelerate
the reduction of emissions

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:19.030
in a way that keeps
1.5 degrees as a floor alive

00:15:19.997 --> 00:15:23.663
and also in a way that guarantees

00:15:23.697 --> 00:15:27.363
that we are seeing the road map
to get to net zero.

00:15:27.397 --> 00:15:31.830
I will personally
be dissatisfied, disappointed